# `basic`

Version 0.3.1

Crate docs for `basic`.

## Overview

Start with [`Config`](latest-basic#struct-config), then look at [`util::helper`](latest-basic-util#fn-helper) and the [`Shape`](latest-basic-shapes#trait-shape) trait.
External items work too: [`Vec`](https://doc.rust-lang.org/stable/std/vec/struct.Vec.html) and [`std::collections::HashMap`](https://doc.rust-lang.org/stable/std/collections/struct.HashMap.html).

## Example

```rust
let config = Config::new("demo");
# not hidden
assert_eq!(config.name(), "demo");
```

## Modules

- [`shapes`](latest-basic-shapes) — Geometry.
- [`util`](latest-basic-util) — Utilities.

## Re-exports

- `pub use std::collections::HashMap` — [`HashMap`](https://doc.rust-lang.org/stable/std/collections/struct.HashMap.html)
- `pub use shapes::*` — [`Shape`](latest-basic-shapes#trait-shape), [`Circle`](latest-basic-shapes#struct-circle)

