## Enums

### enum `Mode`

```rust
#[non_exhaustive]
pub enum Mode {
    Idle,
    Workers(usize),
    Custom { level: u8, label: String },
}
```

[source](https://github.com/example/repo/blob/0123abc/src/lib.rs#L124-L137)

How to run.

**Variants**

- `Idle`

  Do nothing.
- `Workers(usize)`

  Run with a number of workers.
- `Custom { level: u8, label: String }`

  Run with named options.

